          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " person.",
          "start": 766.23,
          "end": 766.37,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, that is not an acceptable excuse.",
