        {
          "word": " Yeah.",
          "start": 1087.06,
          "end": 1087.12,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, as a mercy for the angels, God decided to expose Sheytan first, Sheytan.",
