          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Sheytan.",
          "start": 1145.26,
          "end": 1146.14,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He refused.",
      "start": 1160.12,
      "end": 1160.14,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " He",
          "start": 1160.12,
          "end": 1160.12,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " refused.",
          "start": 1160.12,
          "end": 1160.14,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And this is why I was rather sensitive to the story that ends up giving us the impression",
