          "end": 1259.28,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Sujud.",
          "start": 1259.28,
          "end": 1259.28,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Quran says \"he refused.\"",
      "start": 1259.28,
      "end": 1261.14,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " The",
          "start": 1259.28,
          "end": 1259.28,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Quran",
          "start": 1259.28,
          "end": 1259.28,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " says",
          "start": 1259.28,
          "end": 1259.28,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \"he",
          "start": 1259.28,
          "end": 1260.26,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " refused.\"",
          "start": 1260.26,
          "end": 1261.14,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, these stories are very dangerous.",
      "start": 1261.46,
      "end": 1261.9,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 1261.46,
          "end": 1261.9,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " these",
          "start": 1261.9,
          "end": 1261.9,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " stories",
          "start": 1261.9,
          "end": 1261.9,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " are",
          "start": 1261.9,
          "end": 1261.9,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " very",
          "start": 1261.9,
          "end": 1261.9,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " dangerous.",
          "start": 1261.9,
          "end": 1261.9,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This is why I just, I'm completely averse to them.",
      "start": 1261.9,
      "end": 1263.92,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " This",
          "start": 1261.9,
          "end": 1261.9,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 1261.9,
          "end": 1262.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " why",
          "start": 1262.5,
          "end": 1263.34,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " I",
          "start": 1263.34,
          "end": 1263.34,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " just,",
          "start": 1263.34,
          "end": 1263.34,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " I'm",
          "start": 1263.44,
          "end": 1263.44,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " completely",
          "start": 1263.44,
          "end": 1263.44,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " averse",
          "start": 1263.44,
          "end": 1263.44,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 1263.44,
          "end": 1263.44,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " them.",
          "start": 1263.44,
          "end": 1263.92,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, Sheytan refused, and the angels...",
      "start": 1264.46,
      "end": 1269.6,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 1264.46,
