          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Allah.\"",
          "start": 2387.76,
          "end": 2388.46,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They say \"Muhammadun rasulullah.\"",
