          "end": 2693.1,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " credit.",
          "start": 2693.1,
          "end": 2693.1,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Quran says that.",
