          "start": 2878.76,
          "end": 2878.76,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, Sheytan did not repent.",
      "start": 2878.76,
      "end": 2879.7,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 2878.76,
          "end": 2878.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Sheytan",
          "start": 2879.24,
          "end": 2879.24,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " did",
          "start": 2879.24,
          "end": 2879.42,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " not",
          "start": 2879.42,
          "end": 2879.42,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " repent.",
          "start": 2879.42,
          "end": 2879.7,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And he continued to think that he can rule part of God's kingdom by himself.",
