          "end": 2909.06,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " himself.",
          "start": 2909.06,
          "end": 2909.06,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And this is why he was not pardoned.",
      "start": 2909.06,
      "end": 2909.06,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
