          "word": " powers.\"",
          "start": 2909.06,
          "end": 2909.06,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"And I believe that I can help God, and be His assistant, and rule part of the universe by myself.\"",
