          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This is what he said. \"What is wrong with that? How can I fall prostrate to this tiny creature made of mud?\"",
      "start": 2912.46,
      "end": 2920.74,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " This",
          "start": 2912.46,
          "end": 2912.46,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 2912.46,
          "end": 2914.18,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
