          "end": 2938.88,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " Yes.",
          "start": 2938.88,
          "end": 2941.4,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, we had a division.",
      "start": 2941.4,
      "end": 2942.06,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 2941.4,
          "end": 2941.4,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " we",
          "start": 2941.4,
          "end": 2941.4,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " had",
          "start": 2941.4,
          "end": 2941.58,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " a",
          "start": 2941.58,
          "end": 2941.72,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " division.",
          "start": 2941.72,
          "end": 2942.06,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, the Sheytan and his assistants, they became jinns, yes.",
      "start": 2943.62,
      "end": 2949.44,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 2943.62,
          "end": 2943.72,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 2944.06,
          "end": 2944.06,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Sheytan",
          "start": 2944.06,
          "end": 2944.74,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
