          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " pardoned.",
          "start": 3115.66,
          "end": 3116.06,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Adam and Hawa (Eve) were pardoned.",
