          "word": " pardoned.",
          "start": 3118.32,
          "end": 3118.32,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But not Sheytan, because he continued to insist that he can rule part of the, of the kingdon, God's kingdom by himself.",
