          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " Khalifa:",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "was that... That was before the exposure of Shaytan. A woman (Speaking Farsi): Yes.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Ok.",
          "start": 3478.78,
