          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " of",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Shaytan.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " A",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " woman",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " (Speaking",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Farsi):",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He knew what was in Sheytan's head.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Yes.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " He",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " knew",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " what",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " was",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " in",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Sheytan's",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "See, now we're going back.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " head.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " See,",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " now",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " we're",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " going",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But that was before.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "A woman",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " back.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " But",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " that",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " was",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, before Sheytan was exposed.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " before.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Yeah,",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " before",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Sheytan",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " was",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You see, because they said, you know what they said?",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " exposed.",
