          "word": " \u0623\u064e\u062a\u064e\u062c\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0644\u064f",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0641\u0650\u064a\u0647\u064e\u0627",
