          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "  (2:30)",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0628\u0650\u062d\u064e\u0645\u0652\u062f\u0650\u0643\u064e",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0648\u064e\u0646\u064f\u0642\u064e\u062f\u0651\u0650\u0633\u064f",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Are you familiar with that verse?",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " \u0644\u064e\u0643\u064e",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Are",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " you",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " familiar",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " with",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " that",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We just read it this afternoon. Dr. Khalifa: They said \u0646\u064e\u062d\u0652\u0646\u064f",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "A woman",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " verse?",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " We",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " just",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " read",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " it",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " this",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " afternoon.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " Dr.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " Khalifa:",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " They",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " said",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The angels said \"and we the angels,  \u0646\u064f\u0633\u064e\u0628\u0651\u0650\u062d\u064f \u0628\u0650\u062d\u064e\u0645\u0652\u062f\u0650\u0643\u064e",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
