          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " this,",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " they",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " were",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " not",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because there was one of them who was not doing this. They didn't know. A woman: They didn't know. That's, that's the issue.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
