          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "A woman",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " \u062a\u064e\u0639\u0652\u0644\u064e\u0645\u064f\u0648\u0646\u064e",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, God said \"I know what you do not know.\"",
