          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " that",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " statement,",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " he",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " out",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " of",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " God's",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And he is not guided in his speeches.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Mercy.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " he",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " not",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " guided",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " in",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " his",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has to be on his own.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " speeches.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " He",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " has",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " be",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " on",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " his",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because he's immediately in Sheytan's kingdom. And he doesn't even know it.",
