      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " own.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Because",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " he's",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " immediately",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " in",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Sheytan's",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " kingdom.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " he",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " doesn't",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " even",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " know",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because he says, (1:2) \u0671\u0644\u0652\u062d\u064e\u0645\u0652\u062f\u064f \u0644\u0650\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0647\u0650 \u0631\u064e\u0628\u0651\u0650 \u0671\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0640\u0670\u0644\u064e\u0645\u0650\u064a\u0646\u064e This, this is perfect.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " it.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Because",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " he",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " says,",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " (1:2)",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0671\u0644\u0652\u062d\u064e\u0645\u0652\u062f\u064f",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0644\u0650\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0647\u0650",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0631\u064e\u0628\u0651\u0650",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0671\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0640\u0670\u0644\u064e\u0645\u0650\u064a\u0646\u064e",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " This,",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " this",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And then, he mentions somebody else's name, the Prophet Muhammad, but not only does he",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " perfect.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " then,",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " he",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " mentions",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " somebody",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " else's",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " name,",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Prophet",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Muhammad,",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " but",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " not",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " only",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " does",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "put somebody with Him, he calls him \u0627\u0634\u0631\u0641 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u0633\u0644\u06cc\u0646",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " he",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " put",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
