          "word": " \u0645\u062d\u0645\u062f",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0648\u0639\u0644\u0649",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0622\u0644\u0647",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0648\u0635\u062d\u0628\u0647",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, I was gonna just hold him to that opening and tell him \"Sheikh Sha'rawi, you are out of God's Mercy.\"",
