      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Susan",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Susan.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Susan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Isn't it, isn't this what the Quran teach? I mean, isn't it logical? A woman: You're right.",
