          "word": " you",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I should go there because I don't want you to have the Dukhan (smoke) in the house. Dr. Khalifa: I mean, God bless you.",
