        },
        {
          "word": " or",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " an",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a statement of fact and we see it around us.",
