          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, the answer to this is \"disrespecting the Prophet, or Ali, or Hussein, or any other Prophet, is a forgivable offense.\"",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Namaz.\"",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
