          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " this",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "you know, I say \"the people here, you just...\" because we have beautiful babies, Alhamdu Lillah, M\u00e3 Sh\u00e3 All\u00e3h.",
