          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " hates",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But he cannot touch you because you're protected. You have guards around you, other angels.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " you.",
          "start": 3478.78,
