          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " Khalifa:",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Even the Prophet Muhammad, and this upsets a lot of people, he was an idol worshipper.",
