        },
        {
          "word": " It",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " says",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " in",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "See, and this shocks them. You know, they refuse to see it. They don't wanna see it.",
