          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Sura",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ok.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "A woman",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " 40.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They refuse to believe God, you know. They know better than God. They say \"no, Muhammad was pure and beautiful.\"",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
