          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0631\u064e\u0628\u0651\u064f\u0643\u064f\u0645\u064f",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0671\u062f\u0652\u0639\u064f\u0648\u0646\u0650\u0649\u0653",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0623\u064e\u0633\u0652\u062a\u064e\u062c\u0650\u0628\u0652",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because every action that we do, God is pointing at us and says \"see, he believes in Me.\"",
