        },
        {
          "word": " \u0671\u0644\u0652\u0623\u064e\u0645\u0652\u0648\u064e\u0670\u0644\u0650",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": "  (2:155)",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0648\u064e\u0671\u0644\u0652\u0623\u064e\u0646\u0641\u064f\u0633\u0650",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Everybody must be tested.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Parivash",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " \u0648\u064e\u0671\u0644\u062b\u0651\u064e\u0645\u064e\u0631\u064e\u0670\u062a\u0650",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " Everybody",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " must",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " be",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But, the test never hurts permanently.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Parivash",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " tested.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " But,",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " test",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " never",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " hurts",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The test is characterized...There are tests and there is punishment.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Parivash",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " permanently.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " The",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " test",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " characterized...There",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " are",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " tests",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " and",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " there",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And the difference is, the punishment can leave permanent damage.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Parivash",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " punishment.",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " difference",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " is,",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " punishment",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " can",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " leave",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        },
        {
          "word": " permanent",
          "start": 3478.78,
          "end": 3478.78,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But the test does not leave a permanent damage.",
      "start": 3478.78,
      "end": 3478.78,
      "speaker": "Parivash",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " damage.",
          "start": 3478.78,
